# Astro generated types and caches
.astro/

# Left by the Workers build (a deploy redirect of @cloudflare/vite-plugin) and by local Wrangler
# runs. Secrets for `wrangler dev` never belong in git.
.wrangler/
.dev.vars*

# Collected applicant data: read from real people's public profiles, never committed here (the
# repository is public). On Node the organiser view reads data/applicants.json when it exists; the
# deployed backend keeps its applicants in D1.
data/*
# The event's companies are public information and the same for everyone, so they are shared.
!data/companies.json
# So is the list of public portfolio addresses the test applicants are collected from. What
# is read from those pages (applicants.json) is not.
!data/seeds.json

# The root .gitignore excludes every .env file; the example with empty values is committed.
!.env.example
